                      "proteins rather than tens of thousands, most survivors of the \u2461 ",
                      "sparsity filter are reasonably well measured, and the selection step ",
                      "itself carries known biases \u2014 plain variance with no mean-trend ",
                      "correction, and a hard cut that matters because standardizing then ",
